OL,3,GNEWSAWhitehouse calls on PM to help    
OL,4,Asave lake fish                         
OL,6,FComedian and TV presenter Paul         
OL,7,FWhitehouse has called for the          
OL,8,Fgovernment to help save an at-risk fish
OL,9,Fspecies present in England's largest   
OL,10,Flake since the end of the last Ice Age.
OL,12,FWindermere, in the Lake District, has  
OL,13,Fbeen home to Arctic charr for more than
OL,14,F10,000 years, but campaigners warn     
OL,15,Fextinction beckons as the fish's       
OL,16,Fhabitat is harmed by sewage pollution, 
OL,17,Finvasive species competing for food and
OL,18,Frising temperatures caused by global   
OL,19,Fwarming.                               
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
