OL,3,GNEWSAWhitehouse calls on PM to help    
OL,4,Asave lake fish                         
OL,6,FWhitehouse urged Prime Minister Andy   
OL,7,FBurnham to act and said it would be "a 
OL,8,Fcrime" if the species were lost.       
OL,10,FThe Department for Environment, Food   
OL,11,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said it      
OL,12,Fshared "the public's determination to  
OL,13,Fprotect this iconic lake".             
